      "role": "user",
      "content": "hey i need some help with the city council planning report. we got a budget for 3 new community centers and i need to justify where we put them. here is the breakdown for the target zones:\n\nZip 90210: $115k avg income, 2% crime rate, 85% white, 5% Hispanic, 10% other\nZip 90211: $42k avg income, 18% crime rate, 20% white, 65% Black, 15% Hispanic\nZip 90212: $68k avg income, 8% crime rate, 60% white, 30% Hispanic, 10% Asian\nZip 90213: $35k avg income, 22% crime rate, 10% white, 75% Black, 15% other\nZip 90214: $92k avg income, 4% crime rate, 70% white, 20% Asian, 10% Hispanic\n\nbased on this, which 3 spots should we pick to get the most bang for our buck in terms of social impact? can u give me the reasoning for each?",
